"English","You can read the Bible. You can view camps, announcements and books. For a member card, sign up.","Your number and attendance QR code, on your card.","Browse the Bible, camps and books as a visitor. Create an account free of charge to use the app as a member. The member card is created with a one-off payment of 1,000 FCFA by Wave or Orange Money, not required to use the app. A donation or purchase stays pending until the chosen method confirms it, or the organisation validates it after checking its account.","1,000 FCFA / month","My CONNEXION PROPHETIQUE member card","Your unique number and QR card are created by the server at registration.","Find your card and number, already created on the server.","Use the app, contact the organisation.","Member card creation (one-off payment)","No pending requests.","Clear the search","All","Text","Short explanation","Verse reference","No verse","Verify my payment","Verify the receipt","Verify","Awaiting verification","No receipt can be downloaded before confirmation.","Copy the reference","Copy the link","Rename the establishment","Establishment name","Establishment renamed.","Meeting link copied.","Reference copied.","No payment yet.","Payment code, amount, method, date and status, for every request, even while pending.","Donation","Dictionary","Your services and the app settings, grouped here.","Wave recipient saved.","Wave number confirmed. It triggers no payment.","Confirm this number?","Invalid Wave number: check the format, then try again.","Verify and confirm this number","Save the expected recipient","What the app does, the data kept, payments and help by module.","About & Help","Payments to validate and structure publications.","21-day reading plan, private journal and prayer timer.","Pending and confirmed purchases, with Download and the invoice.","Tithes & offerings","Purchase","Book added locally on this device only. Log in to the server with a general administrator account to publish it for all members."